# Local model checklist (Channel Creator MCP)

Repo: `__REPO_ROOT__`
Python: `__PYTHON__`
StreamTV API: `__BASE_URL__`

## Recommended models

| Hardware | Model | Command |
|----------|--------|---------|
| ~20–24 GB | **Qwen3 32B** (default) | `ollama pull qwen3:32b` |
| ~40+ GB | Llama 3.3 70B Q4 | `ollama pull llama3.3:70b` |
| ~8–16 GB | Qwen3 8B | `ollama pull qwen3:8b` |

Avoid tiny 3B-class models for multi-step Builder tool chains.

## Wire

1. Register the MCP fragment from `generated/` in Continue or Cline (same stdio as Cursor).
2. Paste `generated/intake_system_prompt.md` into the client system / custom instructions.
3. Confirm StreamTV is listening on `__BASE_URL__`.

## Local UX rules

- Cap shortlists to 5–10 candidates before confirm
- Explicit “say **build** to proceed”
- One tool call at a time for ≤8B models
- Never invent channel numbers or Archive `.ia.mp4` URLs
